<h2>About the studio</h2>
<p>DigiRune Studios is me, Will McCullough, working alone out of Beaufort, South Carolina. I build official
companion apps for independent tabletop publishers, plus standalone tools like this one for the wider tabletop
community. I made Sheetmancer for a simple reason: retyping a paper character into a computer is miserable, and I
wanted the paper I already had to just become the digital version. It's a standalone app, no subscription &mdash;
it reads the character you already own, whatever game it came from.</p>
<p class="eff">Sheetmancer is a universal tool for tabletop roleplaying games and is <strong>not affiliated with, or
endorsed by, any game publisher</strong>. Showing a licensed game's sheet being scanned is legitimate demo use;
I keep publisher logos out of thumbnails.</p>

